<title>USA: University of Fla. to First of America. [CORRECTED 18:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>University of Fla. to First of America. [CORRECTED 18:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company in headline and text from Smith Barney to First of America)</p>
<p>First of America (corrects) said it won $10.230 million of Florida State Board of Regents, University of Florida housing facility revenue bonds, Series 1996 A, at a true interest cost of 5.4780 percent.</p>
</text>
